--- !u!114 &1105862584
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1105862582}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4144f17c33745f4428551225776b4b3d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Main::NarrativeTutorialManager
  tutorialSteps:
  - speaker: 5
    note: Welcome
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: Hi. Welcome. Sorry, I should sound calmer than this.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    - text: A quick breath. A strained but professional smile.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 1
    - text: I'm Steaman. I keep this place running, or at least politely prevent
        it from collapsing.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: Here. Take a little emergency fund before we start.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets: []
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 20
  - speaker: 5
    note: Inventory
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: First, your bag.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: "That\u2019s where you check what you're carrying."
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: If you're ever unsure what you have, open the inventory before improvising.
        Please.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 924094138}
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: Resources
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: Up there, you can read your current resources.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: Pearls are the premium asset. Ore matters too, but pearls are what really
        push things forward.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: If something turns ore into pearls, it deserves your attention.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 333419401}
    - {fileID: 1221713461}
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: Turn Counter
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: That counter tracks how far you've gone.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: And how close everything is to becoming a very expensive volcanic cautionary
        tale.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    - text: So yes, time matters.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 775519190}
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: Enemy Gauge
    layoutMode: 1
    lines:
    - text: That gauge is bad news, in a nicely organized format.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: It means a troublesome visitor is getting closer.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: When that fills up, the day tends to become memorable in the wrong way.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 1985854965}
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: Next Day Button
    layoutMode: 1
    lines:
    - text: And that button sends you into the next day.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: "Useful, dangerous, unavoidable \u2014 just like scheduling."
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    - text: Try not to press it before you're ready.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 1697615055}
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: Buildings Overview
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: Now, the buildings.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: These five keep the whole settlement moving.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    - text: Go in, look around, and say hello to the residents when you can.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: They all have opinions. Some of them are even useful.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 949774656}
    - {fileID: 698012694}
    - {fileID: 64911199}
    - {fileID: 542583936}
    - {fileID: 948295391}
    uiHighlightTargets: []
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: NPC Hint
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: Do you see that building.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: This is super important for saving our empire.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    - text: Be sure to explore the different paths and upgrades you can do.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    - text: But most importantly, click the SUBMARINE in the flask. You'll know once
        you get in there.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 949774656}
    uiHighlightTargets: []
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: NPC Hint
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: I also thought I should mention this one to you as well!
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: Please don't neglect this guy, or our empire is as good as gone.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    - text: Anyway, I really do need to get back to work. Good luck.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 948295391}
    uiHighlightTargets: []
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: NPC Hint
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: One last thing.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: If you spot someone out on the map and stop to talk, something unusual
        might happen.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    - text: Could be helpful. Could be expensive. That's community life.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    - text: Anyway, I really do need to get back to work. Good luck.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets: []
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
